<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16158" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσημείωτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unnoticed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηγὴν παρελθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.121
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσαμήωτον αὐτοῦ τὰν παρουσίαν ἀφέμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GDI</u>
					3059.22
				</span></i>
			 (Byzantium, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>without signposts,</i> of a road, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				202
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>not capable of being inferred by signs,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσημείωτα πάντα ποιοῦσι τἀφανῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Sign.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
